{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33301","headline":"田翁叹 · 于濆","name":"田翁叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手植千树桑，文杏作中梁。\n频年徭役重，尽属富家郎。\n富家田业广，用此买金章。\n昨日门前过，轩车满垂杨。\n归来说向家，儿孙竟咨嗟。\n不见千树桑，一浦芙蓉花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}